  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.3: Tooling release. The CLI is also published as the CHDSharp.Cli .NET tool, Windows bundles have winget manifests, and CI now packs and verifies both NuGet packages, checks the tool layout for net8.0/net9.0/net10.0/net11.0, and smoke-installs the tool. The logger-capture tests are serialized. No public API or encoder output changes: 4,223 library tests + 456 encoder tests on each target framework, jb inspectcode 0 findings, CI chdman parity smoke passed. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0/net11.0.",
